@host = http://localhost:5099

### 1) Etkinlik oluştur (startsAt gelecekte olmalı)
# @name createEvent
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Rock Gecesi", "venue": "Harbiye", "startsAt": "2027-01-15T20:00:00Z", "seatCount": 20 }

### 2) Etkinlikleri ara (Dapper)
GET {{host}}/events?search=Rock&page=1&pageSize=10

### 3) Koltuk haritası (Dapper)
@eventId = {{createEvent.response.body.id}}
GET {{host}}/events/{{eventId}}/seats

### 4) Koltuk tut
# @name reserve
POST {{host}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "eventId": "{{eventId}}", "seatNumber": 1, "customerEmail": "ali@example.com" }

### 5) Onayla (koltuk Sold olur)
@reservationId = {{reserve.response.body.reservationId}}
POST {{host}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/confirm

### 6) İptal et (koltuk tekrar Available olur)
DELETE {{host}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}

### Doğrulama hatası denemesi -> 400
POST {{host}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "eventId": "{{eventId}}", "seatNumber": 0, "customerEmail": "gecersiz" }
